{
    "title": "Splash Sports | Survivor & DFS",
    "description": "THE HOME OF PEER-TO-PEER GAMING\r\nMake sports even more fun by putting some skin in the game! Compete in fun, simple, skill-based games that anyone can enjoy, from the most casual sports fans to the true die-hards! Play Survivor, One & Done, Tiers, and Pick\u2019Em for real-money prize pots on Splash Sports. \r\n\r\nCOMPETE AGAINST YOUR FRIENDS IN REAL MONEY CONTESTS\r\nEveryone knows: The House always wins. At Splash Sports, you play against real people. Whether you\u2019re competing against a small group of your closest friends or the community, you\u2019re always playing against other sports fans, and the winner (or winners) takes home the real cash prize pot!\r\n\r\nPLAY THE COMMUNITY FOR REAL CASH PRIZES\r\nFantasy Football fans, join our public contests for NFL and NCAAF this season! Put your sports knowledge and strategy skills to the test against a small community of dedicated sports fans for your best chance at taking home a real cash prize! We have public contests with entry fees from $5 to $100, so you can keep it casual or play big!\r\n\r\nSTART A CONTEST FOR YOUR FRIENDS OR COMMUNITY\r\nLet us handle the hard stuff so you can focus on the fun! Whether you want to organize a contest for a couple of your closest friends or you\u2019re a Commissioner running a contest for a larger community, you'll never have to chase entry fees or pay out winners again. Splash Sports makes it EASY to create a contest, take entries, make picks, and distribute payouts. Ditch the headache and run your contest on Splash Sports this season!\r\n\r\nOFFERING YOUR FAVORITE SPORTS\r\nSplash Sports lets you compete in HUGE Survivor or fantasy contests across all the most popular sports and leagues:\r\n\r\nFootball: NFL, NCAAF\r\nBasketball: NBA, NCAA\r\nGolf: PGA (including The Masters)\r\n\r\nPLAY NFL SURVIVOR AND NCAAF SURVIVOR\r\nAlso sometimes known as \u201cKnockout,\u201d \u201cSuicide,\u201d or \u201cKing of the Hill,\u201d Survivor is Splash Sports\u2019 most popular game format. It\u2019s winner-takes-all and so fun and simple that literally anyone can play! Start a contest for your friend group, compete against your family, or join one of our public contests to play against the community for a chance to take home a massive cash prize!\r\n\r\nTHE MOST FUN AND POPULAR SPORTS GAMES\r\nSplash Sports offers Survivor, Tiers, One & Done, and Pick\u2019Em game formats.\r\nNew for the 2024-2025 football season, we\u2019re excited to be adding both Against the Spread and Confidence gameplay options for our Pick\u2019Em contests. Our One & Done game format will also be available for NFL and NCAAF with Fantasy and Touchdown Scoring options.\r\n\r\nMORE CHANCES TO WIN \r\nSplash Sports makes it incredibly easy to submit multiple entries so you can max enter and increase your chances of winning with just a few clicks!\r\n\r\nContests can be set up with different payout structures: a single payout at the end of the contest, payout intervals throughout the contest, or payouts at the end of each game/tournament, so there are more opportunities to win!\r\n\r\nSWEAT IT OUT WITH LIVE SCORING AND LEADERBOARDS\r\nAlways be in on the action! With Live Scoring and Leaderboards, you\u2019ll know exactly where you stand against your competitors at any moment! \r\n\r\nCHAT WITH YOUR FRIENDS\r\nIf you\u2019re competing in a private contest, you can chat with your fellow players, react to their messages with animated emojis, send images and gifs, and talk smack right in the app!\r\n\r\nFROM THE CREATORS OF RUNYOURPOOL AND OFFICEFOOTBALLPOOL\r\nFrom the owners and operators of two of the largest entertainment-only football and office pool sites in the US, Splash Sports offers legal play for real money in most of the US and Canada. \r\n\r\nRESPONSIBLE GAMING\r\nThis is a real-money gaming app. Please play responsibly and only with amounts you can afford. For gambling addiction help and support, please contact NCPG at 1-800-522-4700 or visit https://www.ncpgambling.org/\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD SPLASH SPORTS\r\nJoin the thousands of users playing Splash Sports for Survivor contests and real money competitions between friends. You won\u2019t find another real money DFS app like it!",
